  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称；|102|＝按玩家性别变化的称谓。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "video",
          "sourceId": "25800001",
          "sourceType": 11,
          "text": "此处为游戏视频演出，尚未转写为文字。",
          "type": "notice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "呼……好冷。\n各位，久等了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "欸……大家都在了吗……抱歉来晚了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，我们的节日信使到了呢！不知道今天会收到什么礼物~\n优纪可是认真写了一整天的心愿单！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "或许是因为看了那种连篇累牍的东西，信使小姐才会迟到吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什么嘛，花迦真过分……\n明明自己的心愿就写了粮丸的尾巴那么长！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "竟……竟然偷看……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "好了，让我来看看清单——\n第一位收件人，优纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "欸？我吗我吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "优纪的礼物，是一份「超大节日惊喜」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是我的第十二个心愿！\n哇……真的这么大！全都是我的吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800012",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "难道说，这个似曾相识的气息是……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "Surprise——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……这就是……「超大节日惊喜」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "见到我你好像很失望呢，让我来猜猜看——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "难道你是在想念某个未被邀请之人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什、什么嘛……哪有的事，今、今天可是「手办之夜」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "噢，原来——那个|102|是位人类呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "你的心愿我看清了，接下来……It's show time！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "好了|101|，你的出场时间到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25800021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "进去看看吧，她们等你很久了。\n……还有，节日快乐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
